    "title": "Avondale PD investigating 'suspicious' disappearance of 3 missing family members - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KYLIE WERNER ,\n11 hours ago Avondale Police are looking for three missing family members who authorities believes disappeared under “suspicious circumstances,” it announced Wednesday. The department said the search for a husband, wife and their adult son began Tuesday after officers conducted a welfare check at a home near Indian School Road and Wigwam Boulevard and found signs of foul play but no one inside. Read full article",
